{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\u00a0<u><strong>- TRAVEL BETWEEN PLANETS</strong></u></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Travel between galaxy sectors containing unique planets.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Move from planet to planet to gather resources.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Travel to the next sector and repeat until you arrive at your missions goal.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3431980/extras/ship_terminal.gif?t=1744916608\" /></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><u><strong>-\u00a0GATHER RESOURCES</strong></u></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Mine the planets precious ores.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Fight ferocious monster inhabiting the planets and gather their loot.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Planets are unstable so you'll have limited time to gather resources.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>-</strong><u> <strong>UPGRADE YOUR ARSENAL</strong></u></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Sell your gathered resources in the shop.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Buy new tools, weapons, perks that will make you stronger and more versatile.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><u><strong>- SAVE THE GALAXY</strong></u></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Your galaxy has been infected by a dreadful poison destroying planets and making the whole galaxy unstable. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Your mission is to navigate to find the root of the poison and destroy it.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>-<u>\u00a0PLAY WITH YOU FRIENDS</u></strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Save the galaxy with your friends!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","backgrou